sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller as 二手卖家
    actor Buyer as 买家
    participant UI as Vue/Nginx
    participant OrderAPI as OrderController
    participant OrderService as OrderServiceImpl
    participant Logistics as LogisticsService
    participant Settlement as EscrowSettlementService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Notify as Notification/Realtime

    Buyer->>OrderAPI: 支付成交订单
    OrderService->>DB: order_status=待发货, pay_status=已支付
    Seller->>UI: 打开我卖出的闲置
    Seller->>OrderAPI: POST /order/{id}/ship
    OrderService->>DB: 校验卖家、付款、状态和 version
    OrderService->>DB: 原子更新为已发货
    OrderService->>Logistics: 初始化唯一物流模板与首节点
    OrderService-->>Notify: 事务提交后通知买家
    Buyer->>UI: 打开二手订单详情
    UI->>OrderAPI: 查询订单详情和物流轨迹
    OrderAPI-->>Buyer: 待收货、包裹已揽收
    Buyer->>OrderAPI: POST /order/{id}/confirm-receive
    OrderService->>DB: 校验买家、状态和 version
    OrderService->>DB: 原子更新为待评价
    OrderService->>Settlement: 释放担保资金
    Settlement->>DB: 卖家个人钱包入账并写资金流水
    alt 结算失败
        DB-->>OrderService: 回滚订单状态、余额和流水
    else 提交成功
        OrderService-->>Notify: 提交后通知卖家并推送状态
        OrderService-->>Buyer: 待评价订单
    end
